Low-Profile Brown sound pack for typebud.

Sound samples from Keyboard Sounds Pro by Nathan Fiscaletti (https://github.com/keyboard-sounds/keyboardsounds-pro), profile 'logitech-g915-tkl-brown', MIT License. Resampled, trimmed and loudness-normalized for typebud.

Source: https://github.com/keyboard-sounds/keyboardsounds-pro (commit bac56ac700635c512e57621f35780c5b79eba4cd, path desktop/bundled-profiles/logitech-g915-tkl-brown).
The upstream license (MIT) is reproduced below and applies to the
audio files in this folder.

